                <pb facs="0629" n="523" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg523"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister O’Brien to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-01-29"><hi rendition="#italic">January 29,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>King Christian died this afternoon at 3.40; had worked until 1, feeling well; at
                    luncheon felt weak, and shortly afterwards died without pain. Dowager Empress of
                    Russia and crown prince of Denmark present when he died.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">O’Brien.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
